1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,200
Long ago, an old keeper lived alone
in a lighthouse on a rocky coast.

2
00:00:05,164 --> 00:00:08,864
Every evening he climbed the spiral
stairs and lit the great lamp.

3
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:13,131
One stormy night, a fishing
boat was lost in the waves.

4
00:00:14,092 --> 00:00:17,355
The keeper watched the sea through
the rain and kept the light turning.

5
00:00:18,316 --> 00:00:21,854
Hours later the boat appeared out of
the dark and sailed safely into the

6
00:00:21,866 --> 00:00:22,466
harbour.

7
00:00:23,332 --> 00:00:27,207
The fishermen cheered on the dock,
and the keeper smiled as the sun rose

8
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:27,982
over the water.
